{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとブログ書けるー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです\n自分の不注意で書けなくなってました(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n海外行ったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ書けない日々が続きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/10/4260454/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ1000回を目前にして\n流石、薄幸な中田！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです！みなさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\nヤンジャン発売でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙です！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーかアンダーがジャックしてるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそくgetしてきたけど\nインパクトすごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙、裏表紙、巻頭、巻中、巻末\n全部\n乃木坂アンダーメンバーです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーにこんなに\n光を当ててくださる機会って\n初めてなんじゃないかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこれは乃木坂のファンなら\nマストで持っておいてください！w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/10/4260454/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余談ですが\nヤンジャンさんの撮影の空き時間に\nヤンジャンさんのマンガを読んで\nそれから中田の中でマンガブームです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はテラフォーマーズ読んでるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/10/4260454/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイプラさんに\nまたまたインタビューを載せていただきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂でアイプラと言えば中田！どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、愛未、中田"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://idol-planet.com/premium/201504/08-nogizaka46-6"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちょうどこの中に出てくる\n撮影でらりと手を繋ぐカットとゆーのは\n昨日発売されたヤンジャンの中にあります！w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドワンゴさんで生ドルの記事が上がりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://news.dwango.jp/index.php?itemid=19448&catid=6"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルの\n松村、中田に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月のゲストの\n真夏、らり、愛未です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/04/10/4260454/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}